{"t":"Halloween","s":"halloween-e1114","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Halloween_event_news_6df276.png","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Halloween event news\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"311\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Halloween_event_news_6df276.png\" width=\"500\"/><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-The_Event\">The Event</span></h2>\n<p>Halloween is an event which is annually held on the 31st of October. <br/>\nYou can find some additional information in the Wikipedia article here.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-The_Halloween_Hare\">The Halloween Hare</span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 180px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"The Halloween Hare on Rookgaard\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"159\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/When_hares_attack_a96ac9.jpg\" width=\"180\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">The Halloween Hare on Rookgaard</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>This event consists of the presence of a small rabbit, <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Halloween%20Hare\">The Halloween Hare</a>. When standing close to it, he can turn NPCs and other creatures into the form of the following creatures:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghost\">Ghost</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mummy\">Mummy</a></li>\n<li>Pumpkinhead</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeleton</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire\">Vampire</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Witch\">Witch</a></li></ul>\n<p>In the past his \"morphbombs\" could also change people and creatures into <a href=\"#/wiki/Blightwalker\">Blightwalkers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Torturer\">Dark Torturers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Phantasm\">Phantasms</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Pirate%20Skeleton\">Pirate Skeletons</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Spectre\">Spectres</a>, but as of halloween 2008 this is no longer possible. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-The_Mutated_Pumpkin\">The Mutated Pumpkin</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Mutated%20Pumpkin\"><img alt=\"The Mutated Pumpkin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Mutated_Pumpkin_247f2f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Mutated%20Pumpkin\">The Mutated Pumpkin</a> starts spawning on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Server%20Save\">Server Save</a> of October 31st and will spawn every 4 hours after that until the Server Save on November 3rd, for a total of 3 days of raids. \n</p><p>The Pumpkin spawns in west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>, around <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33105,32397,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33105, 32397, 7)</a> but with a big radius, so you'll probably have to walk around the desert to find it. Since it has a huge amount of hitpoints, many players are necessary to kill it, even though it doesn't pose any real threat. \n</p><p>After defeating it, players who took part in the fight can use an <a href=\"#/wiki/Obsidian%20Knife\">Obsidian Knife</a> on its corpse that appears east of the city, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33317,32415,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33317, 32415, 7)</a>, to get one of the following rewards:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Spiderwebs\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spiderwebs_d53ef8.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span> Spiderwebs</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Toy Spider\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Toy_Spider_509b94.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Toy Spider</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bat Decoration\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bat_Decoration_7a1992.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span> Bat Decoration</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton%20Decoration\"><img alt=\"Skeleton Decoration\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Skeleton_Decoration_46e265.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton%20Decoration\">Skeleton Decoration</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Yummy%20Gummy%20Worm\"><img alt=\"Yummy Gummy Worm\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Yummy_Gummy_Worm_b135a0.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 20 <a href=\"#/wiki/Yummy%20Gummy%20Worm\">Yummy Gummy Worms</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Surprise Bag (Red)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Surprise_Bag_Red_86ca3a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Surprise Bag (Red)</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Surprise%20Bag%20%28Blue%29\"><img alt=\"Surprise Bag (Blue)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Surprise_Bag_Blue_b0710b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Surprise%20Bag%20%28Blue%29\">Surprise Bag (Blue)</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\"><img alt=\"Bar of Chocolate\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bar_of_Chocolate_988acd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\">Bar of Chocolate</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Pumpkinhead\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pumpkinhead_9dfc1f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Pumpkinhead</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Pumpkin\"><img alt=\"Pumpkin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pumpkin_3e7295.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Pumpkin\">Pumpkin</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Candy%20Cane\"><img alt=\"Candy Cane\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Candy_Cane_850370.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 50 <a href=\"#/wiki/Candy%20Cane\">Candy Canes</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Candy\"><img alt=\"Candy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Candy_419a89.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 50 <a href=\"#/wiki/Candy\">Candies</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\"><img alt=\"Bar of Chocolate\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bar_of_Chocolate_988acd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 50 <a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\">Bars of Chocolate</a></li></ul>\n<p>The portal to this reward room stays open for 30 minutes only, so make sure to get your rewards soon after killing it.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h2>\n<ul><li>2005 the Hare spawned several times a few days before Halloween.</li>\n<li>2006 the Hare spawned 31st of October in <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a> and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20%28Continent%29\">Mainland</a>.</li>\n<li>2007 the Hare spawned 31st of October in <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a> and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20%28Continent%29\">Mainland</a>.</li>\n<li>2008 the Hare spawned 31st of October in <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a> and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20%28Continent%29\">Mainland</a>, in addition <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Mutated%20Pumpkin\">The Mutated Pumpkin</a> also spawned in <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a> (Link to Official News).</li>\n<li>2009 the Hare spawned 3rd of November in <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a> and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20%28Continent%29\">Mainland</a> (the hare overslept 31 October), in addition <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Mutated%20Pumpkin\">The Mutated Pumpkin</a> also spawned west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a> from October 31 until November 2 (Link to Official News).</li>\n<li>2014 <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Mutated%20Pumpkin\">The Mutated Pumpkin</a> spawned from October 31 until November 2.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p>Events</p></div></div>","quests":[]}